"P1880872621" "You defeated Aurora Borealis!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1849991721" "To be honest, I thought I would feel elated when I learned you'd defeated Aurora. I thought I would, but I guess I was wrong. All I feel is... hollow. But at least I won't be forgotten by Paragon City's heroes. Not any more. And neither will you, {VillainName}. They'll be gunning for you now. Hope you've got a good dentist."
// RandomFameString :
"P3660326127" "{VillainName} defeated Aurora Borealis!"

